{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近秋が深まってきて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこら中で金木犀の香りが\n漂ってきますね〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他のメンバーのブログを見ていても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金木犀の香りについて書いてる子が\n多いのですが、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金木犀ってなんでこんなに\n万人受けする香りなんですかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"期間限定だからなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん私も凄く好きな香りなので\n街中で金木犀の香りがすると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《私の秋が始まった❤︎》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と勝手に浮かれている次第で\nございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に、ここ数日は\n通勤途中に金木犀がなっている所を\n通るので朝から気分が上がりますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうちょい続いていて欲しいな、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全ての犬は天国へ行く"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遂に明日が本番となりました〜〜(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初舞台の初日ということで、\n人生で2度は来ない『この瞬間』を\n緊張しつつも楽しもうと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な脚本と演出に加え、\n素晴らしい女優さんたちとの共演。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更には\n支え合えるメンバーたちと\n一緒に舞台に挑めることに\n感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日から12日間\nよろしくお願いします(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこないだは、\nかなり遅めの決起集会！ということで\n犬メンバーで焼き肉へ行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肉を突きながら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふざけた話から\nお芝居に対する真面目な話\n女優さんから学ぶことなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな話をして終始賑やかでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に楽しかったな〜(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本番中も行けたら行きたいね〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて話してるくらいなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"焼き肉でスタミナもついたし\n一体感も生まれてきたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全18公演走り抜けたいと\n思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな怪我なく\n病気なく終われますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれる方に満足して帰って\n貰える公演にするぞ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが\n先日は個別握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテールをやったり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポニーテールをやったり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなお洋服を着ました〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中でも最近のお気に入りは\nこのフリンジピアス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋っぽい洋服にシフトチェンジ\nしつつあります..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会話の方も\nいろんな話が出来ましたが\nやっぱり一番多かったのは\n舞台関係でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってね！見守ってるからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とたくさんパワーを\n頂けたので嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういって直接パワーを頂けるのが\n握手会の魅力だったりもします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方も\nお久しぶりの方も\nいつもぶりの方も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございましたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は10/18かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またたくさんお話しましょ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サガラとキヨトの乃木坂ぷぷぷ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/10〜 テレビ埼玉にて\n乃木坂46の冠番組が始まります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCはバッドボーイズの清人さんと\n我らが相楽伊織！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして埼玉県出身メンバーである、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋元真夏\n井上小百合\n斎藤ちはる\n佐々木琴子\n新内眞衣\n中田花奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もサブレギュラーとして\n出演させて頂きます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや〜〜本当嬉しいですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさか自分がテレ玉の番組に\n出られるなんて！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん我が家はばっちり\nテレ玉が入るので\n毎週チェックしたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週土曜日 深夜0:30〜です。\nテレ玉入るよ！って方は是非\nよろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこの辺で\nおしまいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、部屋を掃除していたら\n懐かしいものが出てきました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知ってる人〜？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！また書きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/09/30/2383163/0012.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}